Currently working around this with this in {{build.gradle}}

 
{code:groovy}
dependencies {
    components {
        withModule("org.apache.kafka:kafka_2.13") {
            withVariant("apiElements") {
                withDependencies {
                    add("org.apache.kafka:kafka-server:${versions.kafka}")
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
{code}

